This JAX port is based on the IPA implementation in:
https://github.com/flagshippioneering/flash_ipa
Revision fdeca12cedda766c5dc8ac484cc9eb4b78738500

The JAX equivalents also cover that revision's model, edge embedding,
factorization, linear initialization, utilities, and rigid geometry modules.
The upstream rigid module credits OpenFold and se3_diffusion:
https://github.com/jasonkyuyim/se3_diffusion
